{"id":1141001,"name":"Helga - Interrogation I","type":"trial","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"Helga - Interrogation I","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1141001]}],"trial":{"trial_id":141001,"stage":"Phase 1","unlock_time":"2026-02-14 05:00:00","diary1":"Following the Farland Alliance's declaration of independence, Fraser swiftly imposed a blockade and embargo on all trade routes. Only one path remains passable, but it cuts through the Alsa Highlands, a region severely contaminated by Mania. Left with no other choice, Helga comes to request your aid in purifying the Mania there. You agree, gather the necessary equipment, and set out for the outpost in the farlands.\n\nSomewhere in the farlands, a group of Fraser soldiers is holding out desperately.","diary2":"Through Helga, you meet the other members of the special squad for this mission. But before you get to chat, a Corruptor ambush nearby signals the further spread of Mania. You have no choice but to move out immediately.\nYet even before setting off, you already sense the differing opinions among the squad members, and their subtle hostility toward you. The road ahead seems full of uncertainty.","evidence":[{"ID":260859,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260860,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241001001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241001002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241001003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241001004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241001005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241001006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241001007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241001008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241001009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241001010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":241001011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id